{"suttaId":"ja148","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ja-i","vriCode":"s0513m.mul","paras":[826,829],"vripara":"148"},"segments":{"ja148:0.4":"Siṅgālajātakaṃ","ja148:1.1":"Nāhaṃ punaṃ na ca punaṃ,","ja148:1.2":"na cāpi apunappunaṃ;","ja148:1.3":"Hatthibondiṃ pavekkhāmi,","ja148:1.4":"tathā hi bhayatajjitoti.","ja148:2.1":"Siṅgālajātakaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ. 149."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ja-a-i","bookName":"Jātaka-aṭṭhakathā-1","vriCode":"s0513a1.att","from":3072,"to":3072,"paras":[{"para":3072,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja148:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>na cāpi apunappuna</b>nti a-kāro nipātamatto.","Ayaṃ panetissā sakalāyapi gāthāya attho – ahañhi ito puna, tato ca punāti vuttavārato puna tatopi ca punappunaṃ vāraṇasarīrasaṅkhātaṃ <b>hatthibondiṃ na pavekkhāmi</b>.","Kiṃkāraṇā?","<b>Tathā hi bhayatajjito,</b> tathā hi ahaṃ imasmiññeva pavesane bhayatajjito maraṇabhayena santāsaṃ saṃvegaṃ āpāditoti."],"lineRefs":[["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["ja148:1.1","na cāpi apunappunaṃ",0,0],["ja148:1.3","tathā hi bhayatajjito",0,3]]},"tika":{"book":"Ja-ṭ-i","bookName":"Jātaka-abhinavaṭīkā-1","vriCode":"","from":1445,"to":1449,"paras":[{"para":1445,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja148:1"],"lines":["8-siṅgālajātakavaṇṇanā (148)"],"lineRefs":[["ja148:1"]]},{"para":1446,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja148:1"],"lines":["<b>kilesaniggaha</b>nti kilesānaṃ niggahaṃ.","<b>anto koṭisanthāre</b>ti koṭisanthāro nāma jetavanassa anto hiraññakoṭiyo santharitvā vikkiṇito bhūmipadeso.","<b>kilesanissito saṅkappo</b>ti kilesanissito vitakko.","saṃsaddo panettha tabbhāve.","<b>attanā jahitakilese</b>ti attanā pubbe jahitakilesārammaṇe.","kilesārammaṇampi hi kilesoti vuccati kāraṇopacārena.","<b>aḍḍharattasamanantare</b>ti aḍḍharattiyā samanantare.","rattiyā vemajjhakāle atikkanteti vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>sabbaññutañāṇadaṇḍadīpaka</b>nti sabbaññutañāṇadīpagehaṃ.","<b>katarāya nu kho rattiyā [ratiyā (ṭṭha)] </b>ti katarena nāma rattinivāsena.","rattiyā kattabbakammaṃ rattināmena vuccati.","<b>satthā ca nāmā</b>tiādīsu satthā ca nāma attano sāvake rakkhatīti sambandho.","kimivāti āha “ekaputtikā”ti ādi.","ekaputtikā itthī attano puttaṃ rakkhati viya ekacakkhuko puriso cakkhuṃ rakkhati viya cāti sambandho.","<b>surabhigandhakuṭito</b>ti sugandhehi vāsitakuṭito.","suṭṭhuṃ rabhanti tussanti etenāti surabhi.","surabhi yeva gandhoti surabhigandho.","tena vāsitā kuṭi surabhigandhakuṭi.","<b>nikkhamitvā</b>ti kesarasīho viya kañcanaguhā nikkhamitvā.","<b>apāpuraṇa</b>nti kuñcikaṃ.","kuñcikā hi apāpurati vivarati yenāti apāpuraṇaṃ.","vara-saṃvaraṇeti dhātu.","va-kārassa pa-kārādeso a-kārassa u-kārādeso upasaggassa ca dīghatā daṭṭhabbā.","apārutā te amatassa dvārāti vacanato pura-pāra-saṃvaraṇe-tipi dhātvatthaṃ paṭhanti.","ava-pubbo vu-saṃvaraṇetipi dhātvatthe pana sati va-kārassa ra-kāratā upasaggassa ca dīghatā daṭṭhabbā.","apārutā saṃghāṭiṃ pārupitvāti ādīsu pana pakāravaṇṇāgamanena siddhoti daṭṭhabbo."],"lineRefs":[["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"]]},{"para":1447,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja148:1"],"lines":["<b>sīlapathaviya</b>2nti catupārisuddhisīlasaṅkhātāya pathaviyaṃ.","<b>patiṭṭhahamāno</b>ti samādānavasena patiṭṭhahamāno.","<b>sineru viyā</b>ti yugandharādīhi parikkhitto sineru viya sāvakehi parikkhitto paññatte buddhāsane nisīdi.","<b>āveḷā yamakā yamakā [āveḷā veḷā.(ṭṭha)] </b>ti ettha attho heṭṭhā vuttanayena veditabbo.","<b>kūṭāgārakucchimattā</b>ti kūṭāgārassa vemajjhaṭṭhānamattā.","vemajjhaṭṭhānaṃ hi kucchisadisattā kucchīti vuccatīti.","evaṃ aṇṇavakucchītiādīsu.","<b>bālasūriyuggamanakālo viyā</b>ti taruṇasūriyuggamanakālo viya.","<b>rattakambalasāṇiyā</b>ti rattakambalena kattabbasāṇiyā.","sāṇīti ca parikkhipanatthāya sibbitacoḷaviseso.","yā javanikāti vuccati.","saṇati saddaṃ karotīti sāṇi.","saṇa-abyattasaddeti muddhajaṇakārantadhātu.<b>4 kāmavitakka</b>nti vatthukāmakilesavasena uppannavitakkaṃ.","<b>byāpādavitakka</b>nti cittāvilatāya kodhavasena uppannavitakkaṃ.","<b>vihiṃsā vitakka</b>nti paresaṃ vihiṃsanavasena uppannavitakkaṃ.","<b>avaññātu</b>nti avamaññituṃ.","<b>pacchāmittasadiso</b>ti patiamittasadiso.","verīpuggalasadisoti attho.","paccāmitto ca khuddako nāma natthi okāsaṃ labhitvā vināsameva pāpetīti ettha laṭukikajātakādīni dassetabbāni.","laṭukikā hi khuddakā itthī ca samānāpi mahantaṃ purisaṃ ekacāraṃ nāma hatthiṃ nāsetuṃ samatthāti.","<b>uppāṭitacchavigaṇḍasadiso</b>ti ghaṃsitvā uppāṭitachavigaṇḍavaṇasadiso.","<b>allīyitu</b>nti āsajjituṃ.","<b>paṭisaṅkhābalenā</b>ti vīmaṃsanabalena.","<b>bhāvanābalenā</b>ti asubhādibhāvanābalena.","<b>vinivaṭṭatī</b>ti pavattati.","adho patatīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"]]},{"para":1448,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja148:1"],"lines":["<b>soṇḍe</b>ti hatthikare.","suṇati sañcalatīti soṇḍo.","soṇa-vaṇṇagatīsūti dhātu.","soḍati pagabbatīti vā soṇḍo.","niggahitāgamo cettha daṭṭhabbo.","<b>naṅgalasīse [naṅgalisāya.(ṭṭha)] </b>ti naṅgalassa sīse agge.","atha vā naṅgalameva phālānaṃ uparisīsabhāge ṭhāne ṭhitattā naṅgalasīsoti vuccati.","<b>suppakoṭiya</b>nti kullassa koṭiyaṃ ante.","<b>kusule</b>ti koṭṭhe.","dhaññāgāre.","yo veḷuādīhi aññamaññaṃ jaṭāpetvā parimaṇḍalākārena kato.","<b>kusule</b>ti kusanti veḷupesikādayo aññamaññaṃ āhacca tiṭṭhanti etthāti kusulo.","kusa-silesaneti dhātu.","atha vā kusena aññamaññabandhanena ulanti patiṭṭhahanti veḷupesikādayo etthāti kusulo.","<b>udukkhale</b>ti dhaññakoṭṭanopakaraṇaviseso.","uddhaṃ ukkhalati sodheti punāti etenāti udukkhalo.","<b>musale</b>ti ayogge.","musati khaṇḍatīti musalo.","musa-khaṇḍaneti dhātu.","muse vā khaṇḍane alanti musalo.","<b>kuṇapa</b>nti kuṇo vuccati kimi.","tena pivitabboti kuṇapo.","taṃ kuṇapaṃ.","<b>valiyo</b>ti sithiladhammatāya rājiyo gaṇḍi.","<b>lokantarikanivāso viyā</b>ti tiṇṇaṃ lokānaṃ antare ṭhitattā lokantarikoti laddhanāme niraye nivāso viya.","<b>ukkhaliya</b>nti thāliyaṃ.","thālī hi ukhati patiṭṭhahati bhojanaṃ etthāti ukkhali.","ukha-gamaneti dhātu.","atha vā ukhaṃ vuccati bhattaṃ.","taṃ lāti gaṇhātīti ukkhali.","<b>piṭṭhapiṇḍi viyā</b>ti taṇḍulacuṇṇapiṇḍi viya.","<b>tārakā viyā</b>ti gaganatale nakkhattaṃ viya.","<b>tālakandasadisenā</b>ti tālamūlavisesa-sadisena.","yo sālukanti vuccati.","kantitabbo chinditabboti kanto.","kantoyeva ta-kārassa da-kāraṃ katvā kandoti vuccati.","<b>na ca puna</b>nti ettha vācāsiliṭṭhatāya niggahitāgamo daṭṭhabbo.","atha vā punasaddassa atthe eko nipātoyevāti daṭṭhabbo.","<b>ito punā</b>ti imamhā kālamhā puna.","<b>tatopi ca punā</b>ti dutiyakālamhā puna.","evaṃ vuttavārato tatiyakālamhā puna.","<b>tatopi ca punappuna</b>nti catutthakālamhāpi ca punappunaṃ.","<b>hatthibondi</b>nti hatthissa sarīraṃ.","bundati nisāmeti mānaṃ etthāti bondi. bunda-nisāmaneti dantajatatiyakkharantadhātu.","vuṇoti vā saṃvarati etthāti bondi.","<b>anto uppannakilesassa nāma vaḍḍhituṃ adatvā</b>ti anto santāne uppannakilesassa nāma vaḍḍhituṃ okāsaṃ adatvā tattha tattheva naṃ niggaṇhituṃ vaṭṭatīti atthoti."],"lineRefs":[["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"],["ja148:1"]]},{"para":1449,"vripara":null,"refs":["ja148:1"],"lines":["siṅgālajātakavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["ja148:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
